ver\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:499:- delete `observer-state` and `observe-step!` from `dao.jing` and its\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:500:  `dao.stream` require; delete the observer section of `jing_test.cljc`;\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:505:  The recommendation is to **fold back**: move the v2 observer into `dao.jing`\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:512:## Host matrix\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:516:| J1    | ✓   | ✓           | ✓    | three host branches in `dao.jing.file`, `:cljd` first; Node uses synchronous `fs`         |\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:517:| J2    | ✓   | ✓           | ✓    | pure `.cljc`, no host branch                                                              |\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:518:| J3a   | ✓   | ✓           | ✓    | pure `.cljc`, no host branch                                                              |\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:519:| J3b   | ✓   | ✓           | ✓    | composition uses the per-host `connect!` seam; cljd through the cljd ws lane              |\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:520:| J4    | —   | —           | —    | prose                                                                                     |\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:521:| J5    | ✓   | ✓           | ✓    | deletions; confirm every `dao.jing*` test namespace still appears in each host's output   |\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:527:## Invariants, checked\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:535:  transport's, confined to J3b's composition.\ncollab/architect-dao-jing-v2-plan.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md:538:- **Interpretation and execution